{{ candidate }}

{{ request }}

Reply with ONLY a JSON object: "recommended_roles" (3-5 job titles), "salary_target_usd" (integer annual USD), "resume_edits" (3-5 concrete changes), "additional_advice" (short paragraph).
{%- else -%}
As a job seeker, I'm pasting my resume below and want your guidance.

{{ candidate }}

{{ request }}

Your entire reply must be a single JSON object with keys: "recommended_roles" (list of 3-5 titles), "salary_target_usd" (integer), "resume_edits" (list of 3-5 edits), "additional_advice" (paragraph).
